  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>All these carbocations are stabilised by resonance. But the one which has maximum conjugation or maximum resonating structures will be most stable.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\ot4_0188_ba410cacc4ef.png\" style=\"width: 215px; height: 50px;\" /></p><p>Is most stable carbocation since it has maximum conjugation and also&nbsp;it&nbsp;is stabilised due to mesomeric effect of methoxy group.</p>"
